        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Linda Eder, Frank Wildhorn, Steve Cuden, Leslie Bricusse, Robert Louis Stevenson\n- Works: Jekyll & Hyde, The Strange Case of Dr Jekyll and Mr Hyde\n- Roles: Lucy\n- Topics: Broadway, musical horror-drama, Drama Desk Award\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Louis Stevenson wrote the novella The Strange Case of Dr Jekyll and Mr Hyde.\n- Jekyll & Hyde is a musical horror-drama loosely based on Robert Louis Stevenson’s novella The Strange Case of Dr Jekyll and Mr Hyde.\n- Frank Wildhorn and Steve Cuden originally conceived Jekyll & Hyde for the stage.\n- Jekyll & Hyde features music by Frank Wildhorn, a book by Leslie Bricusse, and lyrics by Frank Wildhorn, Leslie Bricusse, and Steve Cuden.\n- Linda Eder, born on February 3, 1961, is an American singer and actress.\n- Linda Eder made her Broadway debut in Jekyll & Hyde and originated the role of Lucy.\n- Linda Eder was nominated for a Drama Desk Award for her role as Lucy in Jekyll & Hyde.",
